  "title": "San Martín's crossing of the Andes",
  "summary": "In January 1817 José de San Martín led the Army of the Andes, reported at more than 5,000 men, out of Mendoza and over the Andes into Chile in two columns, one through the Los Patos pass and one through Uspallata. The army reached Chile on 5 February and won the Battle of Chacabuco on 12 February.",
