  "reviewer_note": "Least sure: the start date and army size (sources disagree: January 6, 12 or 18; 3,550 vs 5,000+). The Universidad de Mendoza page has a typo (\"2017\") that was read as 1817. The pass has no sourced coordinate, so the path has two waypoints. Links to Ayacucho and Bolívar are thematic, not causal claims.",
